  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-limegreen pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Gamma Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e3/Radioactive_Man_%28Chen_Lu%29.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20251113131137\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Radioactive Man (Chen Lu)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e3/Radioactive_Man_%28Chen_Lu%29.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/348?cb=20251113131137\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e3/Radioactive_Man_%28Chen_Lu%29.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/348?cb=20251113131137 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/e/e3/Radioactive_Man_%28Chen_Lu%29.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20251113131137 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Radioactive Man (Chen Lu)\" width=\"270\" height=\"388\" data-image-key=\"Radioactive_Man_%28Chen_Lu%29.jpeg\" data-image-name=\"Radioactive Man (Chen Lu).jpeg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Radioactive Man (Marvel Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb and convert gamma radiation</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>absorb gamma radiation and convert it to other forms of energy</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Gamma_Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Gamma Radiation Manipulation\">Gamma Radiation Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Gamma_Absorption\" title=\"Gamma Absorption\">Gamma Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGamma_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Gamma Radiation Conversion</li>\n<li>Gamma Ray Conversion</li>\n<li>Gamma Transduction</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGamma_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb gamma radiation and convert it to other forms.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGamma_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Capacitor\" title=\"Bio-Capacitor\">Bio-Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Accumulation\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Accumulation\">Bio-Energetic Accumulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Radiation_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Radiation Manipulation\">Bio-Radiation Manipulation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Signature_Alternation\" title=\"Energy Signature Alternation\">Energy Signature Alternation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Conversion\" title=\"Ionic Conversion\">Ionic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gamma_Accumulation\" title=\"Gamma Accumulation\">Gamma Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gamma_Concentration\" title=\"Gamma Concentration\">Gamma Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gamma_Energizing\" title=\"Gamma Energizing\">Gamma Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Gamma_Reactor\" title=\"Bio-Gamma Reactor\">Bio-Gamma Reactor</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Gamma_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Gamma Radiation\">Personal Gamma Radiation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Ionization\" title=\"Personal Ionization\">Personal Ionization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Thermal_Radiation\" title=\"Personal Thermal Radiation\">Personal Thermal Radiation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Weak_Force\" title=\"Personal Weak Force\">Personal Weak Force</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gamma_Capacitor\" title=\"Gamma Capacitor\">Store</a> and convert radiation into other types of energy, such as:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Generation\" title=\"Heat Generation\">Heat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Generation\" title=\"Fire Generation\">Flame</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Radiation_Generation\" title=\"Cosmic Radiation Generation\">Cosmic</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Radiation_Generation\" title=\"Ionic Radiation Generation\">Ion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Plasma_Radiation_Generation\" title=\"Plasma Radiation Generation\">Plasma</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lunar_Generation\" title=\"Lunar Generation\">Lunar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Generation\" title=\"Solar Generation\">Solar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Generation\" title=\"Stellar Generation\">Stellar</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Generation\" title=\"Electromagnetism Generation\">Elecromagnetism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Generation\" title=\"Electricity Generation\">Electricity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Light_Generation\" title=\"Light Generation\">Light</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magnetism_Generation\" title=\"Magnetism Generation\">Magnetism</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sound_Wave_Generation\" title=\"Sound Wave Generation\">Sound</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Radiation_Conversion\" title=\"Thermal Radiation Conversion\">Thermal Radiation Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Conversion\" title=\"Electromagnetic Conversion\">Electromagnetic Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Conversion\" title=\"Heat Conversion\">Heat Conversion</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection